-- Week of Mon 21 to Sun 27 September 2026, cooking for one. Two sessions, 16 portions.
-- Shopping Tuesday evening at Royal Oak. Tuesday's is the rice cooker one because the shop
-- does not get home until late; Wednesday's is the big one that carries the rest of the week
-- and fills the freezer.

= 2026-09-22

-- 4 portions: Tuesday night, Wednesday lunch, Wednesday night, one spare for Thursday lunch.
-- Shopping Tuesday evening, home late, so this is the rice cooker one: ten minutes of chopping, everything in
-- cold, press the button, eat around 10. Nothing to watch and nothing to wash but the bowl.
@./recipes/dinner/Japanese Chicken Rice Cooker{}

= 2026-09-23

-- 12 portions: Thursday to Sunday, dinner and lunch, and the rest frozen.
-- ~20 minutes hands-on (chopping) and 2 hours in the oven doing nothing. Start it when you get
-- in and it is done by 9. Four portions to the fridge, eight to the freezer — cooked mince is
-- a three-day thing in the fridge and this week is five.
@./recipes/dinner/Big Batch Bolognese{}
